{"key":"t65-bio-1.1","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"A","final_answer":"Much of the heat added to water is used to break hydrogen bonds between water molecules before the molecules can move faster.","working":"Water's high specific heat results from extensive hydrogen bonding. Added heat first disrupts these intermolecular hydrogen bonds rather than immediately increasing molecular kinetic energy, so temperature rises slowly. Choices B and C are factually wrong: covalent bonds do not break, and water is polar. Choice D is not the primary explanation; density does not trap heat in the way described.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":465,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":209,"cacheReadTokens":256},"outputTokens":319,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":124,"reasoningTokens":195},"totalTokens":784,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":465,"completion_tokens":319,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":209,"total_tokens":784,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":195}},"reasoningTokens":195,"cachedInputTokens":256},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4844,"keyed_label":"A"}
{"key":"t65-bio-1.1","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"A","final_answer":"Much of the heat added to water is used to break hydrogen bonds between water molecules before the molecules can move faster.","working":"Specific heat is the amount of heat energy required to raise the temperature of 1 g of a substance by 1°C. Temperature is a measure of the average kinetic energy of the molecules. In water, extensive intermolecular hydrogen bonding holds molecules together. When heat is added, much of the initial thermal energy is consumed in breaking these hydrogen bonds rather than immediately increasing the kinetic energy (speed) of the molecules. Therefore, water requires a relatively large input of heat to achieve a given temperature increase.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":412,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":412,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":438,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":155,"reasoningTokens":283},"totalTokens":850,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":283,"promptTokenCount":412,"candidatesTokenCount":155,"totalTokenCount":850,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":412}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":155}]},"reasoningTokens":283,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4998,"keyed_label":"A"}
